<title>UK: Foreningsbanken two $100 mln FRNs.</title>
<headline>Foreningsbanken two $100 mln FRNs.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following two floating-rate issues for $100 million each were announced by lead manager Salomon Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FORENINGSBANKEN AB</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY  * PERPETUAL</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN  ** 75 BP     PAY DATE    18.DEC.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A3	  ISS PRICE  99.785    FULL FEES   0.625</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    99.785</p>
<p> NOTES    * CALL FROM DECEMBER 2001 AT PAR</p>
<p>	   ** STEPS UP TO 225 BP AFTER FIVE YEARS</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 250	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SWEDEN    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.375     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> RANK	 JUNIOR SUBORDINATED</p>
<p>* * * * *  AMT    $100 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     55 BP     PAY DATE    16.DEC.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A3	  ISS PRICE  99.717    FULL FEES   0.50</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    99.717</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SWEDEN    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> RANK	 NORMAL SUBORDINATED</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
